'''Splitnir''' is the sixth [[Spears|spear]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Ashlands-tier weapons, the Splitnir can be upgraded to one of the following three variants using gemstones:

* {{Item link|Splitnir the Bleeding}} ([[Bloodstone]])
* {{Item link|Splitnir the Storming}} ([[Iolite]])
* {{Item link|Splitnir the Primal}} ([[Jade]])

An upgraded Splitnir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using gemstones.

